<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>SoundMind Admin</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" />

    <style>
        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, #dbeafe, transparent 35%),
                radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, #e9d5ff, transparent 35%),
                #f8fafc;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .left-side {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 70px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .brand-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .7);
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 58px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .hero-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #0f172a, #6366f1);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-desc {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .7);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, .05);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #eef2ff;
            color: #4f46e5;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .login-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 32px;
        }

        .login-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 32px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, .12);
        }

        .login-title {
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .input-group-text {
            background: white;
            border-right: none;
            border-radius: 16px 0 0 16px;
        }

        .form-control {
            border-left: none;
            border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            box-shadow: none;
            border-color: #ced4da;
        }

        .btn-login {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #111827, #4f46e5);
            transition: .25s;
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            opacity: .96;
        }

        .footer-note {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        @media(max-width:992px) {
            .left-side {
                display: none;
            }

            body {
                overflow: auto;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container-fluid min-vh-100">
        <div class="row min-vh-100">
            <!-- LEFT -->
            <div class="col-lg-6 left-side">
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-badge">
                        <i class="bi bi-soundwave"></i>
                        SOUNDMIND ADMIN
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="hero-title">
                        Quản trị nội dung<br>
                        <span class="hero-gradient">tinh gọn & hiện đại</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="hero-desc">
                        Theo dõi audiobook, quản lý nội dung và vận hành nền tảng SoundMind với trải nghiệm quản trị
                        trực quan.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <div class="feature-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center">
                        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-headphones"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Quản lý Audiobook</div>
                            <div class="text-secondary small">Kiểm soát thư viện và nội dung dễ dàng</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center">
                        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Theo dõi tăng trưởng</div>
                            <div class="text-secondary small">Dữ liệu vận hành theo thời gian thực</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="footer-note mt-4">© 2026 SoundMind Admin</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- RIGHT -->
            <div class="col-lg-6 login-wrapper">
                <div class="card login-card p-4 p-lg-5">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="text-center mb-4">
                            <div class="mx-auto mb-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle"
                                style="width:70px; height:70px; background:#eef2ff; color:#4f46e5; font-size:28px;">
                                <i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="login-title">Đăng nhập Admin</div>
                            <div class="text-secondary mt-2">Chào mừng quay trở lại</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Cập nhật Form POST trực tiếp lên Server -->
                        <form action="<%= routeUrl %>/login" method="POST">
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <label class="small text-muted mb-2">Username</label>
                                <div class="input-group">
                                    <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-person"></i></span>
                                    <input name="username" type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Nhập username"
                                        required />
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <label class="small text-muted mb-2">Password</label>
                                <div class="input-group">
                                    <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-lock"></i></span>
                                    <input name="password" type="password" class="form-control" placeholder="••••••••"
                                        required />
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Hiển thị thông báo lỗi từ Server gửi về (nếu có) -->
                            <% if (typeof error !=='undefined' && error) { %>
                                <div class="alert alert-danger py-2 small">
                                    <%= error %>
                                </div>
                                <% } %>

                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-login text-white w-100 mt-2">
                                        Đăng nhập
                                    </button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>